THM3866_GRAPH_CLASSIFICATION F=C-6s(A)(1+As(A)), b=b0+QF
THM3866_FORMAL_QUOTIENT Q_*=sum q_j(C)A^j, deg q_j=j+1, lc beta_j
THM3866_FIRST_MISMATCH Q=Q_<N+A^N T, T(0,C)!=q_N
THM3866_RESIDUAL S=R_N-54u_N T-27A^(N+2)F T^2
THM3866_SPECIAL S(0,C)=54(q_N-T(0,C))!=0
THM3866_DEGREES d<N:2N+1; d>N:2d+1; d=N:2N+1
THM3866_RESONANCE lc=-27A^N(beta_(N-1)+A lc(T))^2 !=0
THM3866_REPLAY_UNIVERSE generic s-jets j<=4; N=0..4; d=N-1,N,N+1,N+2
THM3866_SCOPE all polynomial graph branches; non-graph A1 and A=0 open
